    {
      "url": "https://www.bwgoalkeeping.co.uk/about-us",
      "title": "About Us | BW Elite Goalkeeping Coaching",
      "file": "about-us",
      "headings": [
        "WHAT DO WE OFFER?",
        "GROUP SESSIONS",
        "Our Group Goalkeeping Sessions are held weekly across several venues. Goalkeepers of all ages and abilities are able to attend. Our aim is to ensure goalkeepers are working in a fun, safe and professional environment as well as developing their goalkeeping techniques and game understanding. All sessions are led by UEFA Licenced Goalkeeping Coach.",
        "ONE-TO-ONE SESSIONS",
        "One-to-One sessions are available to goalkeepers of all ages and abilities. Sessions are designed to suit the needs of the individual and can be filmed upon request for in depth analysis. These are available to book for Morning/Afternoon/Evening and can be 45, 60 or 90 minutes. Our aim is to ensure all individuals improve their game and develop game knowledge through game realistic scenarios.",
        "ELITE TRAINING DAYS",
        "Our Elite Goalkeeping Training Days are open to goalkeepers of all abilities from U7-U16's. The 3-hour Training Days are designed to help and develop goalkeepers through the delivery of technical and game realistic practices. We can ensure that your child will be provided with professional and detailed coaching, focusing on both in & out of possession aspects of goalkeeping.",
        "Terms and Conditions",
        "Privacy Policy",
        "Safeguarding Policy",
        "07908108638 CONTACT@BWGOALKEEPING.CO.UK"
      ]
    },
    {
      "url": "https://www.bwgoalkeeping.co.uk/services",
      "title": "Services | BW Elite Goalkeeping Coaching",
      "file": "services",
      "headings": [
        "OUR SERVICES",
        "GROUP SESSIONS",
        "Our Weekly Group Goalkeeping Sessions are open to goalkeepers of all ages and abilities who are looking to develop their goalkeeping in a fun, safe and professional training environment. We ensure our sessions are filled with technical and game realistic practices, covering all aspects of goalkeeping on a rotational basis, including both in and out of possession topics.",
        "ONE-TO-ONE SESSIONS",
        "These are available to goalkeepers of all ages and abilities. Sessions are designed to suit the needs of the individual and can be filmed upon request for in depth analysis. These are available to book for Morning/Afternoon/Evening and can be 45, 60 or 90 minutes. Our aim is to ensure all individuals improve their game and develop game knowledge through game realisitc scenarios in a fun and professional environment.",
        "ELITE TRAINING DAYS",
        "Our Elite Goalkeeping Training Days are open to goalkeepers of all abilities from U7-U16's. The 3-hour Training Days are designed to help and develop goalkeepers through the delivery of technical and game realistic practices. We can ensure that your child will be provided with professional and detailed coaching, focusing on both in & out of possession aspects of goalkeeping",
        "Terms and Conditions",
        "Privacy Policy",
        "Safeguarding Policy",
        "07908108638 CONTACT@BWGOALKEEPING.CO.UK"
      ]
    },
